{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "水壇之法如餘\n部說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長短正當以人一肘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云如意寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合，唐云虎皮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云芸臺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作酪殘汁也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "等人一肘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若耶反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喫云，外國語也，即同大唐破滅語訓。他者，是外\n道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "患此瘡者悉皆死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此蛇\n人見即死"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二手內縛，竪二中指頭相合，並屈二大指，各以二頭指屈\n握二大指甲根，頭指甲皆背相著"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仰左手各竪五指，將右手下向，以中指無名指頭\n各各相拄著"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二句誦二七遍"}
